CREATE TABLE "User" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"avatar" TEXT NOT NULL,"totalScore" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"correctGuesses" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"matchesPlayed" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"wins" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE "Match" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"roomCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"startedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL,"finishedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL,"durationMs" INTEGER NOT NULL,"totalTurns" INTEGER NOT NULL,"completedTurns" INTEGER NOT NULL,"settingsJson" TEXT NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE "MatchResult" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"matchId" TEXT NOT NULL,"playerId" TEXT NOT NULL,"score" INTEGER NOT NULL,"correctGuesses" INTEGER NOT NULL,"rank" INTEGER NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "MatchResult_matchId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("matchId") REFERENCES "Match" ("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "MatchResult_playerId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("playerId") REFERENCES "User" ("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "MatchResult_matchId_playerId_key" ON "MatchResult"("matchId","playerId");
CREATE TABLE "Word" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"text" TEXT NOT NULL,"category" TEXT NOT NULL,"difficulty" TEXT NOT NULL);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Word_text_key" ON "Word"("text");
